{
  "_id": "tg-chastening",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "I, will chastise you seven times for your sins, Lev. 26:28. as a man chasteneth his son, so the Lord, Deut. 8:5. I will chasten him with the rod of men, 2 Sam. 7:14. despise not thou the chastening of the Almighty, Job 5:17 (Prov. 3:11). I have borne chastisement, I will not offend any more, Job 34:31. Blessed is the man whom thou chastenest, Ps. 94:12. Reprove not a scorner, lest he hate thee, Prov. 9:8. he that loveth him chasteneth him betimes, Prov. 13:24. Chasten thy son while there is hope, Prov. 19:18. Withhold not correction from the child, Prov. 23:13. rod and reproof give wisdom, Prov. 29:15. poured out a prayer when thy chastening was upon them, Isa. 26:16.",
